{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16915","headline":"窦三中丞去岁有台中五言四韵未及酬报今领黔南途经蜀门百里而近愿言欵觌封略间然因追曩篇持以赠之 · 武元衡","name":"窦三中丞去岁有台中五言四韵未及酬报今领黔南途经蜀门百里而近愿言欵觌封略间然因追曩篇持以赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"在昔谬司宪，常僚惟有君。\n报恩如皎日，致位等青云。\n削藁书难见，除苛事早吟。\n双旌不可驻，风雪路岐分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}